# Resolved dependency lockfile. BaryPlots is a library, not an application: consumers
# resolve their own environment from Project.toml's [deps] and [compat], so a committed
# Manifest is never read by them and only goes stale. It is still generated locally for
# development and regenerates on `Pkg.instantiate()`.
Manifest.toml

# Julia build and coverage artifacts
/docs/build/
/docs/site/
*.jl.cov
*.jl.*.cov
*.jl.mem
